# M-ALL02 -- W2-CA-05 side fallback + W2-CA-01 EnteredBy. ALL02s: the player
# house (Americans, side from RA2 rules.ini) is a combatant from f=0; an
# engineer captures the chapel -> 'American Captures 1st' -> 'Player Wins'
# -> WON (no 'Chapel Destroyed' loss). The capture is the real engineer order;
# the Confederation/Russian houses are removed on the way (combat skip).
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL02s.MAP GDI

until 60 scene == campaign-load
require scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
require scene == game
assert mode == campaign
assert side(0) == ALLIED
until 6000 objectives >= 1
cheat camp_capture ENGINEER 13 CACOLO01
cheat kill_house 7
cheat kill_house 8
until 9000 outcome == WON
assert outcome == WON
